                        ],
                        "form": "парапе́те"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "91acf48e-3005-482a-99e8-7a7e0ee47ee5",
                        "entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "парапе́тах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6c8da649-7e59-30f5-95bc-b3f60e20993d",
                        "entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "архит. невысокая стенка, ограда вдоль чего-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "113fdaea-ab64-481b-b972-b737d2b3ad71",
                                "sense_id": "6c8da649-7e59-30f5-95bc-b3f60e20993d",
                                "text": "Агния натянутой рукой быстро повлекла Антона дальше — к паперти главного входа, вышла из тени в поток заката и села на низкий каменный парапет, где обрывалась ограда и начинался просвет для ворот."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63433780-3d0e-435b-9aee-ea76ab64aba5",
                                "sense_id": "6c8da649-7e59-30f5-95bc-b3f60e20993d",
                                "text": "Чугунный кованый парапет отсверкивал на солнце золочёными набалдашниками; романтические фонари стояли в два ряда, на чугунных столбах да тяжёлых цепях; узор новой брусчатки из окна машины я разглядеть не сумел, но цвет её был розов."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e67cdad-2c54-32f3-bbe9-3564db1a544a",
                        "entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воен., устар. вал для защиты от неприятельских пуль, ядер и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fdd83522-0be6-4430-b253-74d541e7804e",
                                "sense_id": "6e67cdad-2c54-32f3-bbe9-3564db1a544a",
                                "text": "Спустя неделю интенсивного боя на парапете появляется мальчишка, размахивающий белым платком"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e516153-dcb7-3fc4-91ac-b03e1ba0f2ee",
                        "entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "техн. стенка, располагаемая на гребне плотины, мола, дамбы и т. п. и защищающая сооружение от размыва волнами; также стенка, устраиваемая в судоходных шлюзах для ограждения территории, примыкающей к камере"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b759b87-4b26-45bd-be7b-8ef7ac62f7e8",
                                "sense_id": "5e516153-dcb7-3fc4-91ac-b03e1ba0f2ee",
                                "text": "Вода перехлёстывала уже через парапет реки Фонтанки."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "84e68c03-c1e5-411a-88c5-8f8b9cfbb2c5",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "source_sense_description": "невысокая стенка, ограда вдоль чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "parapet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parapet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8117b4a-56d5-3cb1-900d-b1611176bd59",
                                        "entry_id": "110fe0f7-5c9d-310d-9602-d3d10c86ce36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A low protective wall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67aca827-2a1e-4b9c-8c21-2887b14d17b6",
                                                "sense_id": "e8117b4a-56d5-3cb1-900d-b1611176bd59",
                                                "text": "Engineers will be closely checking the bridge for damage beyond the obvious smashed parapets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05760b65-8b74-31c0-a2ed-649b8c6e7aaa",
                                        "entry_id": "110fe0f7-5c9d-310d-9602-d3d10c86ce36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Part of a perimeter that extends above the roof."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11a85f03-a59a-4c87-872d-7879bceed744",
                                                "sense_id": "05760b65-8b74-31c0-a2ed-649b8c6e7aaa",
                                                "text": "Maccario, it was evident, did not care to take the risk of blundering upon a picket, and a man led them by twisting paths until at last the hacienda rose blackly before them. Appleby could see it dimly, a blur of shadowy buildings with the ridge of roof parapet alone cutting hard and sharp against the clearing sky."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb355f10-917a-3fe5-ba0d-b6a6f0aac73c",
                                        "entry_id": "110fe0f7-5c9d-310d-9602-d3d10c86ce36",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fortification consisting of a wall."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "660b0088-16dc-4259-be32-1e57c211d6d0",
                                                "sense_id": "eb355f10-917a-3fe5-ba0d-b6a6f0aac73c",
                                                "text": "Obviously if you have only a few days in which to train a soldier, you must teach him the things he will most need; how to take cover, how to advance across open ground, how to mount guards and build a parapet – above all, how to use his weapons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4b95b13e-31fa-4fd2-b91d-33c04814b8b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "source_sense_description": "невысокая стенка, ограда вдоль чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "balustrade",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "balustrade",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49064ec5-1913-3492-9862-2fad58691659",
                                        "entry_id": "7422dab5-b1b7-3b0b-9a6c-98825d60e59b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A row of balusters topped by a rail, serving as an open parapet, as along the edge of a balcony, terrace, bridge, staircase, or the eaves of a building."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25909899-688a-4a95-aa82-af639fece015",
                                                "sense_id": "49064ec5-1913-3492-9862-2fad58691659",
                                                "text": "So on a pleasant morning, as he leant / Into the sun-rise, o’er the balustrade [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "038599ee-7685-485a-84eb-4491664b2854",
                                                "sense_id": "49064ec5-1913-3492-9862-2fad58691659",
                                                "text": "The Jester sat down on one of the marble balustrades and regarded Alvin with a curious intentness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9594775-f3e6-4fcf-b0ff-2eda5ad633ec",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7217682-107b-3f1d-9d4b-a4b9bca60f28",
                        "source_sense_description": "невысокая стенка, ограда вдоль чего-либо",
                        "target_lang_word": "breastwork",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "breastwork",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9bd981d-d9ae-3826-91d7-4ad3b91c3627",
                                        "entry_id": "abe22ffd-9c32-3d46-9f84-25a410278936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fortification consisting of a breast-high bulwark; a parapet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d296f22-684e-43c0-9aec-f66dc16a36da",
                                                "sense_id": "f9bd981d-d9ae-3826-91d7-4ad3b91c3627",
                                                "text": "Before long we had flung enough sand-bags into place to make a low breastwork behind which the few men who were on this side of the position could lie down and fire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a136977-e925-4f5f-bd27-c6e3458d07b6",
                                                "sense_id": "f9bd981d-d9ae-3826-91d7-4ad3b91c3627",
                                                "text": "A cannonproof breastwork, built during the previous war, extended along the beach from the hills to the rocks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26c7eee0-4bc6-3928-938b-7cf44385f63c",
                                        "entry_id": "abe22ffd-9c32-3d46-9f84-25a410278936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A railing on the quarter-deck and forecastle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d372376-0fbc-4251-a496-695de663944f",
                                                "sense_id": "26c7eee0-4bc6-3928-938b-7cf44385f63c",
                                                "text": "The Independencia is a two-turreted, breastwork ship of 9,000 tons displacement. […] The central breastwork is 130 feet in length at the top of the belt, and extends to the upper deck, 11 feet above the water-line. This breastwork incloses the boiler and engine hatches, the scuttles to magazines and shell-rooms, the principal openings for ventilation, and the two turrets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "092fa105-5cbc-343c-88ae-9aca3410ff46",
                                        "entry_id": "abe22ffd-9c32-3d46-9f84-25a410278936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A parapet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12be0c99-a748-411e-acae-4c566f5a1ec6",
                                                "sense_id": "092fa105-5cbc-343c-88ae-9aca3410ff46",
                                                "text": "A swarthy boy opened a book and propped it nimbly under the breastwork of his satchel. He recited jerks of verse with odd glances at the text: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8719caa-cee0-38c8-9e4b-8b4414155ec8",
                                        "entry_id": "abe22ffd-9c32-3d46-9f84-25a410278936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Breast augmentation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
